    {
      "id": "claim_a86ec49bc63e421dbc8f664f6120764a",
      "statement": "panicHandler recovers panics: without STEPDEBUG=1 it prints a friendly message with the exact STEPDEBUG=1 reproduction command and exits with code 2; with STEPDEBUG=1 it prints the version and re-panics to preserve the stack. The base exit-code contract is 0 success, 1 command error, 2 panic.",
      "evidence": [
